  <h2 id="sales">Who pays for these skills, and how they judge you</h2>

  <p>
    Firms and clients pay for credible data, compliance and real savings. They judge you by accuracy, honesty and practical results.
  </p>
  <p>
    The first basic skill is tracing one number from a bill to a table.
  </p>

  <h2 id="ai">AI and ESG and business sustainability careers: which tasks are under pressure</h2>

  <p>
    AI tools draft reports and collect public data. Report drafting shrinks first.
  </p>
  <p>
    Checking data quality, understanding the operation and owning the claims hold value. A staged path helps: now, use AI to draft; later, own the verification.
  </p>

