  <h2 id="data">What credible sustainability data looks like</h2>

  <div class="table-wrap">
    <table class="paths-table paths-table--wide">
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th>Check</th>
          <th>Good practice</th>
          <th>Warning sign</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr>
          <td data-label="Check"><strong>Source</strong></td>
          <td data-label="Good practice">Data traced to bills, logs or records</td>
          <td data-label="Warning sign">Numbers with no source</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td data-label="Check"><strong>Scope</strong></td>
          <td data-label="Good practice">Clear boundary of what is counted</td>
          <td data-label="Warning sign">Vague claims</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td data-label="Check"><strong>Method</strong></td>
          <td data-label="Good practice">Same method each period</td>
          <td data-label="Warning sign">Changing method to look better</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td data-label="Check"><strong>Claims</strong></td>
          <td data-label="Good practice">Plain, checkable statements</td>
          <td data-label="Warning sign">Large claims with no evidence</td>
        </tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>
  <p>
    Credibility is the core of this field. Practise showing your working.
  </p>

  <h2 id="audit">A one-day review you can do for a small place</h2>

  <p>
    This is a practice exercise. Keep the claims small and the records clear.
  </p>
  <div class="table-wrap">
    <table class="paths-table paths-table--wide">
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th>Hour</th>
          <th>Task</th>
          <th>Record</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr>
          <td data-label="Hour"><strong>1</strong></td>
          <td data-label="Task">List major energy uses: lights, fans, cooling, equipment</td>
          <td data-label="Record">A list with counts</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td data-label="Hour"><strong>2</strong></td>
          <td data-label="Task">Collect twelve months of electricity bills if available</td>
          <td data-label="Record">A bill table</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td data-label="Hour"><strong>3</strong></td>
          <td data-label="Task">Walk the site and note waste and leaks</td>
          <td data-label="Record">A photo-free notes list</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td data-label="Hour"><strong>4</strong></td>
          <td data-label="Task">Estimate the effect of two simple changes</td>
          <td data-label="Record">A cautious estimate with assumptions</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td data-label="Hour"><strong>5</strong></td>
          <td data-label="Task">Write a one-page note</td>
          <td data-label="Record">What you counted, what you did not, next step</td>
        </tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>
  <p>
    Do not publish claims about savings you have not measured.
  </p>

