        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td data-label="Term"><strong>Disclosure</strong></td>
          <td data-label="Plain meaning">Publishing information</td>
          <td data-label="Why it matters">Must be accurate and consistent</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td data-label="Term"><strong>Audit trail</strong></td>
